Phase 7 must generate, per spec section 5 -- all FROM THE RUN, none hand-written:

  RUN-MANIFEST.json   UTC timestamp, git commit, Python version, numpy/pandas/
                      scipy/matplotlib versions, the exact interpreter path, every
